From: Varun-iiitb <var3907@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:07:56 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 55/68] Demo page: the type scale, the title in the app bar
 once the header has scrolled away, "Identity check", no random scenario (task
 21, C and review)

- Text styles from AppTypeScale (the theme's type scale) in LivenessStyle's
  colours, instead of the page's own sizes.
- The app bar is empty while the blue header (which carries the title) is
  in view; once the header has scrolled under it, "Face liveness demo"
  fades in (150 ms). The header's height is kept after the list drops it.
- The section "Identity check (F15)" is "Identity check": the F-codes stay
  in code and docs.
- Simulated screens: 12 rows; RANDOM stays on the debug page (a demo shows
  a known screen).

Tests: the app bar title (hidden at the top, shown below the header, also
once the list has dropped the header, hidden again at the top); no random
row; the other 11 as before. flutter test test/liveness: 299 passing, 20
skipped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
